# Views toolkit + shell gfx + product GIS horizon → one DLL (dll_stem = ui_views).
# Product exe is //src/app/views (import/link, not LoadLibrary).
# Not in //src:src_all or //src/ui:ui (MFC).
# Single export: UI_EXPORT / UI_EXPORTS (ui/ui_export.h) for all of //src/ui.
#
# Sibling DLLs (import-link only — never absorb their TUs into this PE):
#   //src/content:content  (dll_stem=content; :view_host group → :content)
#   //src/tool:tool        (dll_stem=tool; content already public_deps :tool)
#   //src/render:rhi       (group → render.dll)
#
# Layered source_sets (first-cut GN decoupling; still one DLL via :ui_views):
#   views_kernel           — View/Widget/layout/shell/paint/compositor (no
#                            primitives/dialogs/markup deps or includes)
#   views_control_factory  — ControlFactory + MarkupAttrs registry only (kernel;
#                            no pugixml/Yoga/MarkupDocument)
#   views_primitives       — Button/Label/… + primitive markup registration
#                            (deps factory registry, not full markup)
#   views_markup           — XML/CSS/Yoga + layout/GIS placeholder registration
#   views_dialogs          — Dialog shell + MessageBox/FilePicker/InputText/
#                            SelectOne (toolkit only; GIS dialogs → //src/ui/gis)
#   views_map              — DrawHost + TouchMultitouch
# Aggregate :views_sources (+ make_default TU) + //src/ui/gis:gis_sources
# → :ui_views → group :views. GIS TUs stay under ui/gis/; same PE / UI_EXPORT.
#
# Public includes are responsibility-partitioned:
#   "ui/views/<area>/<group>/foo.h"
# markup/ nests style|document|layout|factory|loader (+ testdata/).
# Product .ui.xml/.ui.css live in //src/ui/resources/<area>/ (copied to
# out/ui/<area>/; relative path preserved).
# map/ nests viewport|input|frame|device; root keeps public forward headers
# (draw_host.h, map_viewport.h legacy, touch_multitouch.h). testing/ is test-only
# (not linked into :ui_views): testing/unit and testing/pixel.
# Goldens stay at testing/testdata/.
# Stable labels :views and //src/ui/gfx:gfx forward to :ui_views.
# //src/ui/gfx:gfx_headers is include-only (gpu / present; no this DLL).

